# 02: the piano roll. A note placed and made longer, a chord picked with Y, the tempo tapped in from the roll.
title THE PIANO ROLL
about Notes and chords on a synth track: A places a note, hold Y to pick a chord, and up from the top of the bar the tempo is tapped in with A.
caption PIANO ROLL
run --demo --view notes
from 1.0
length 20.0

1.2 say The piano roll.
2.2 tap RIGHT 2 0.3
2.9 tap DOWN
3.4 tap A
3.4 say A places a note.
4.4 say Hold A, down: longer.
4.4 hold A 1.4
4.8 tap DOWN 2 0.35
6.2 tap DOWN 4 0.15
7.0 say Hold Y: the chords. Left, right picks one.
7.0 hold Y 3.0
7.8 tap RIGHT 3 0.6
10.2 say Let go: it lands.
11.4 say Up from step 1: TEMPO.
11.4 press UP 0.5
12.0 tap UP 4 0.25
13.0 say Tap A in time: the tempo follows.
13.2 tap A 6 0.4
17.6 say Hold A, up: a beat faster.
17.6 hold A 1.8
18.0 tap UP 3 0.4
